PLACEHOLDER — do NOT commit a real google-services.json secret here.

Download the real file from the Firebase Console and place it at:

    android/app/google-services.json

How to get it:
  1. Firebase Console → your project → Project Settings → Your apps
  2. Add app → Android → package name: co.nz.inflowapp
  3. Download google-services.json
  4. Copy it to android/app/google-services.json
     (scripts/android-setup.sh will look for it there and warn if missing)

This is the SAME Firebase project the iOS app uses (GoogleService-Info.plist) — the
server sends FCM through one project for both platforms.
